# Firmware and userspace drivers for an AMD GPU. No capability gates this:
# having the card is the whole reason to want it. The ROCm compute stack is a
# separate choice and lives in `rocm`.
#
# This widens what the old tree did — it scoped this to the workstation
# usage — so a rented host with a passed-through AMD GPU now gets its driver.
# A host without the card is unaffected, because the fact does not hold.
kind: packages
requires: repos
when: gpu:amd
root: yes
